# Text is stored as LF in the index whatever a machine's core.autocrlf says.
# Without this, a leaked `core.autocrlf=false` override (the Daytona launch sets one)
# turned a Windows CRLF checkout into 148 CRLF files in one commit (#56, OAV-34),
# and release-please then failed to bump the CRLF pyproject.toml.
* text=auto
